msgid "Selected bandwidth"
msgstr "选定频宽"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:431
msgid "Selecting a channel"
msgstr "正在自动选信道"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:539
msgid ""
"Separate channels with spaces. Use a hyphen for a range. Leave empty to use "
"every channel compatible with the selected bandwidth."
msgstr "用空格分隔信道，范围用连字符表示。留空则使用所有与所选频宽匹配的信道。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:434
msgid "Starting wireless"
msgstr "正在启动无线"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:633
msgid ""
"The upstream router may assign a new management address. With checked apply, "
"LuCI rolls back if it cannot confirm the change before the timer expires."
msgstr ""
"上级路由器可能分配新的管理地址。使用带回滚的应用时，如果 LuCI 无法在倒计时内"
"确认，系统会恢复之前的配置。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:71
msgid "Unable to check saved settings. Reload the page and try again."
msgstr "无法检查已保存的设置，请刷新页面后重试。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:542
msgid "Enter channel numbers from 1 to 233 or ascending ranges, separated by spaces."
msgstr "请输入 1 到 233 的信道编号或升序范围，并用空格分隔。"

